---
// Experience.astro: Professional career and verified experience timeline
---

<section class="w-full flex flex-col gap-6" id="experiencia">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-primary-fixed-dim font-medium">
        02 // Trayectoria Profesional
      </span>
      <div class="h-px w-10 bg-white/20"></div>
    </div>
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
      Experiencia Laboral Verificada
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 relative">
    <!-- Connecting Line -->
    <div class="absolute left-4 top-4 bottom-4 w-px bg-white/[0.08] hidden md:block"></div>

    <!-- Role 1: Secretaría de Innovación -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-5 items-start">
      <!-- Timeline Marker -->
      <div class="hidden md:flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#181a26] text-primary border border-white/[0.12] shadow-md z-10 shrink-0">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">domain</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Card -->
      <div class="w-full flex-1 p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl bg-[#13151f]/75 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/[0.07] shadow-xl hover:border-white/[0.18] transition-all flex flex-col gap-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <div class="flex flex-col">
            <span class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-white">Secretaría de Innovación de la Presidencia</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-primary">Desarrollador de Software</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:items-end">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-emerald-400 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 self-start sm:self-auto font-medium">
              08/2024 – Presente
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-0.5">San Salvador, El Salvador</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bullet Points -->
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-sm text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[17px] mt-0.5 shrink-0">check</span>
            <span>
              Desarrollo activo de plataformas institucionales para trámites ciudadanos críticos utilizando <strong class="text-white font-medium">Vue.js, TypeScript y Tailwind CSS</strong>, garantizando accesibilidad y alta disponibilidad.
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[17px] mt-0.5 shrink-0">check</span>
            <span>
              Implementación de formularios dinámicos y componentes modulares altamente reutilizables con validación estricta de esquemas, reduciendo la tasa de peticiones rechazadas por datos inconsistentes.
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[17px] mt-0.5 shrink-0">check</span>
            <span>
              Consumo e integración de APIs RESTful institucionales con manejo asíncrono avanzado, pipelines de caché y control resiliente de excepciones.
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Tech Badges Used -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-2 border-t border-white/[0.06]">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/[0.04] text-neutral-300 border border-white/[0.06]">Vue.js</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/[0.04] text-neutral-300 border border-white/[0.06]">TypeScript</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/[0.04] text-neutral-300 border border-white/[0.06]">Tailwind CSS</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/[0.04] text-neutral-300 border border-white/[0.06]">RESTful APIs</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/[0.04] text-neutral-300 border border-white/[0.06]">Clean Architecture</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Role 2: Ministerio de Economía -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-5 items-start">
      <!-- Timeline Marker -->
      <div class="hidden md:flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#181a26] text-neutral-400 border border-white/[0.12] shadow-md z-10 shrink-0">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">account_balance</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Card -->
      <div class="w-full flex-1 p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl bg-[#13151f]/75 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/[0.07] shadow-xl hover:border-white/[0.18] transition-all flex flex-col gap-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <div class="flex flex-col">
            <span class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-white">Ministerio de Economía</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-secondary">Desarrollador de Software (.NET) – Práctica / Servicio Social</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:items-end">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-300 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/[0.05] border border-white/[0.08] self-start sm:self-auto font-medium">
              2024
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-0.5">San Salvador, El Salvador</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bullet Points -->
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-sm text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[17px] mt-0.5 shrink-0">check</span>
            <span>
              Diseño y construcción de módulos internos para la Dirección de Tecnologías de Información bajo <strong class="text-white font-medium">arquitectura por capas en C# (.NET)</strong> y Microsoft SQL Server.
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[17px] mt-0.5 shrink-0">check</span>
            <span>
              Optimización de lógica de negocio en capa de servicios y desarrollo de procedimientos almacenados (Stored Procedures) con indexación avanzada para consultas analíticas veloces.
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Tech Badges Used -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-2 border-t border-white/[0.06]">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/[0.04] text-neutral-300 border border-white/[0.06]">C# (.NET Core)</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/[0.04] text-neutral-300 border border-white/[0.06]">SQL Server</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/[0.04] text-neutral-300 border border-white/[0.06]">Stored Procedures</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/[0.04] text-neutral-300 border border-white/[0.06]">N-Tier Architecture</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>